10 - 18 Oct 2020 Perfecting Your Michelin Weddings at Peony Jade @ Keppel Club
https://singaporebrides.com/wedding-show/18-oct-perfecting-your-michelin-weddings-at-peony-jade-keppel-club/
Peony Jade @ Keppel Club, A Proud MICHELIN Plate Restaurant 209 & 2018 sets the scene for your memorable once in a lifetime milestone celebration. With personalized and intuitive services, Peony Jade helps you create memorable moments for your big day with attention to the finest details.
Whether you desire an intimate celebration or a grand banquet, our wedding specialists will be your trusted confidants in all matters. We want to help you make your dream come true. So relax and let our ever-ready team of hospitality professionals promise to turn your dream nuptial into reality.
Book now to receive additional perks of a complimentary bottle of house wine for every 10 guaranteed guests and one 20-litre barrel of beer for wedding above 80 guests (For Weddings & Solemnisation Celebrations held during PHASE 2 Opening with UP to 80guests).
Bask in more fabulous perks & glorious savings with minimum booking of 200 guests OR an expenditure of $20,000 :
LUNCH & DINNER BANQUET :   COMPLIMENTARY 1 FREE table for every 12 payable tables;
Enjoy WAIVER of 10% Service charge and 7% GST;
Complimentary 1 table with every guaranteed booking of 12 tables;
Enjoy WAIVER of corkage charges for all duty-paid liquors and wines brought in for the banquet event ;
Enjoy One-Night Accomodation in a 5-stars Hotel with ABF served the morning after before check-out ;
Enjoy Free printing of wedding invitation card inserts (Standard Print Only);
Enjoy 15 % Car-passes based on the confirmed attendance;
BONUS !  COMPLIMENTARY Solemnisation Signing Ceremony – Say your “I DO’s” against the stunning panoramic backdrop of the South China Sea or opt for a more intimate solemnization at our Private Room with fresh floral centerpiece, feather pens and ring pillow.
EXTRA Perks: We provide exclusive two-way COMPLIMENTARY shuttle coach services for your valued-guests (who prefer SG’s efficient public transport system) from Harbour Front MRT Taxi stand to the door-step of our MICHELIN Plate Restaurant in Keppel Club.

